<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>经络循行 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%9C%E5%BE%AA%E8%A1%8C/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.158.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.3</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 27 Nov 2025 15:34:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%9C%E5%BE%AA%E8%A1%8C/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>考订经脉篇第十七</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-17/</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Nov 2025 15:34:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-17/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>这份《考订经脉篇第十七》的内容非常丰富，它不仅仅是解剖学上的经脉走向描述，更是一部**“经脉气化动力学”&lt;strong&gt;。岐伯的回答揭示了经脉运行背后的深层逻辑——即&lt;/strong&gt;五行生克、脏腑伦理（君臣父子夫妇）以及天人相应**的哲学原理。</description></item><item><title>经脉终始篇第十四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-14/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Nov 2025 11:25:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-14/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>主要探讨了&lt;strong&gt;十二经脉的流注方向（终始）&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;阴阳气血的关系&lt;/strong&gt;以及&lt;strong&gt;脉气运行顺逆&lt;/strong&gt;的判断标准。</description></item><item><title>经脉相行篇第十三</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-13/</link><pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 10:20:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-13/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>此篇主要论述经脉的循行。黄帝鉴于原讲十二经之行有不够细致全面之处，有意借测验太子雷公，使之请教天师以便明确，是一篇微言奥旨。从而说明黄帝父子好学好问，为后世留遗产以利万民，诚不愧为圣帝！此篇细致精微的问答，可补《内经》之不足，而有助于中医经络之研究，以发挥其未知功能。</description></item><item><title>经脉第十</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-10/</link><pubDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 12:40:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-10/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>本篇详述了十二经脉在全身的分布和循行情况，以及十五络脉的名称、循行路径及其虚实病候的表现。全篇内容，都着重在说明经脉具有决生死、处百病、调虚实的重要作用，所以篇名叫做&amp;quot;经脉&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>气府论篇第五十九</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE59%E6%B0%94%E5%BA%9C%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E5%8D%81%E4%B9%9D/</link><pubDate>Sat, 29 Mar 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE59%E6%B0%94%E5%BA%9C%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E5%8D%81%E4%B9%9D/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文系统阐述了足三阳经、手三阳经及奇经八脉的脉气循行路线及其对应穴位分布，共计三百六十五穴，与天地之气相应。</description></item></channel></rss>